00:10:05,360 --> 00:10:09,600
When we're taking a lot, it is a burden to the liver.

00:10:09,600 --> 00:10:13,400
The liver does have to process all of that.

00:10:13,400 --> 00:10:17,600
So maybe if you're taking a ton of supplements already,

00:10:17,600 --> 00:10:20,080
