00:10:31,960 --> 00:10:34,120
so you're not burdening the system.

00:10:34,120 --> 00:10:36,160
But other than that, I mean, I don't really

00:10:36,160 --> 00:10:38,600
know of any specific contraindications.

00:10:38,720 --> 00:10:40,360
So certainly, if you feel compelled,

00:10:40,360 --> 00:10:43,880
you can try it as a cancer balancer might not.

00:10:43,880 --> 00:10:48,520
Like I said, it might not work to fight the cancer

00:10:48,520 --> 00:10:50,640
